 md+="\nPrimary32 and equal-log original-eight aggregate require upper ON/control ratios below1 and at least10/15wins against both controls. Every other case including primary16 and merge54 requires upper ratios≤1.02. All ten OFF/accepted calibration intervals must fit factor1.03; every maximum RSS ON/control ratio must be≤1.05. Paired ranks4–12of15 give conditional nominal96.484375% individual median coverage, without familywise coverage. No gain floor, excluded observation, extension, successful rerun, changed threshold or subset adoption. A passing screen still needs portable/resource/final-artifact qualification. [Frozen design](artifacts/design.md).\n\n## Counters and profiles\n\nEach counter panel is a single diagnostic observation, not an isolated cause or repeated-trial confidence interval. All four events require≥99.9% running coverage.\n\n|Panel|Instructions/request million|Cycles/request million|Qualified|\n|---|---:|---:|---|\n";
